00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:12.588
The fleeting dream I saw in spring
was engulfed by the hectic summer...

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:14.171
...and became a tiny scar.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:21.050
The sorrowful fall breeze faintly
tells the story behind the scar.

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:35.668
It tells who you truly are inside...

00:00:54.387 --> 00:01:01.054
Why? Somehow you seem upset
Why? Nandaka ochikonderu mitai

